disassembler
=============

This repository is a decoupled extraction of the Logan cDBG path-walking
component from https://github.com/nekrut/logan-hypyaeon.

The native Rust walker (walker/) and the intra-accession haplotype-recovery
work originate from logan-hypyaeon PR #4 ("Haplotype recovery"), authored by
Andrew (@as042), which built on the PR #3 Rust port. The reference Python
prototype (python/logan_path_walker.py) and the design/measurement documents
under docs/ likewise originate from that project.

The upstream history was squashed into a single import commit here. Original
authorship and the full investigation record are preserved in the upstream
repository and in docs/ (see docs/upstream_pr4_description.md,
docs/issue_intra_accession_variance_lost.md, docs/rust_walker_as_built.md).
